{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/20927-mummies-and-the-god-machine","id":20927,"title":"Mummies and the God-Machine","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-30T19:08:21-08:00","id":20927,"title":"Mummies and the God-Machine","content":"It's been stated that, canonically, the G-M has no part in the Mummy mythos. That said, what do you think it would be like for the Deathless if they did encounter it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T19:28:46-08:00","id":20936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/20927-mummies-and-the-god-machine#post20927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's been stated that, canonically, the G-M has no part in the Mummy mythos. That said, what do you think it would be like for the Deathless if they did encounter it?</div> </div> </div> </div>You know the sterotype of an elderly person dealing with new techology?<br /> <br /> True be told, I would use the God-Machine to drive home the point of future-shock for Mummies more than anything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T19:56:53-08:00","id":20948,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d have the GM be older than the Nameless Empire. In particular, I\u2019d play up rumors of GM Infrastructure designed to project people all the way back to the time of the Nameless Empire (what Marco Singe called the Age of Osiris), along with similar Infrastructure targeting each of the Sothic Turns. Since I tend to prefer the Pyramid Framework, this would generally involve modern cultists visiting the past and participating in the Arisen\u2019s earlier Descents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T13:06:20-08:00","id":21843,"title":"","content":"In the game we're currently playing, I've done a bit of meshing things together. The God Machine was actually the dimension traveling reality engine/vessel of the otherworldy Shaun'iatu. When the GM broke through into the WoD, it was attacked by Father Wolf and damaged. It retreated into the world to repair and the Shaun'iaut were left to explore the world and colonize/make it their own...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/906-qoorl","name":"Qoorl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T14:41:53-08:00","id":21902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Qoorl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/20927-mummies-and-the-god-machine?p=21843#post21843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the game we're currently playing, I've done a bit of meshing things together. The God Machine was actually the dimension traveling reality engine/vessel of the otherworldy Shaun'iatu. When the GM broke through into the WoD, it was attacked by Father Wolf and damaged. It retreated into the world to repair and the Shaun'iaut were left to explore the world and colonize/make it their own...</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, this is a supercool crossover idea. It even hearkens back to the GMC plot seed about the GM being a crashed alien ship with missing aliens","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T16:17:20-08:00","id":21960,"title":"","content":"I can't stop laughing at the image of the Urfarah jumping out into space and fucking up flying saucers. Best game of frisbee ever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T05:30:38-08:00","id":22282,"title":"","content":"Well, I was trying to give a good chunk of the WoD a common origin point if not actual origin. The Urfarah is wounded crippling the godmachine. The Shaun'iatu need the GM up and running to rewrite the WoD in a more orderly fashion. The GM needs ephemera to make repairs. Obvious the Shadow is out because Urfarah is still alive at this point. And So the Shaun'iatu using their advanced magic/necrotechnology make a deal with a handful of Ghosts. The GM will rewrite them, make them something more than they were, and in return they'll funnel ghosts toward the GM. It uses the ghosts, breaks them down to make Angels so it can repair. A few problems arise. The 'mind' of the GM is too damaged to ever be fully functional again. What's more because of the source of the ephemera, sometimes the Angels the GM makes go rogue, develop too much individuality. Of course once Father Wolf gets patricided, the Spirit world is open to harvesting and it can use spirits to render down and remake in it's image. Of course with it's recycling system, ghost ephemera still gets used and Angels continue to Fall just not as often.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/906-qoorl","name":"Qoorl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T11:39:02-08:00","id":22467,"title":"","content":"Hehehe, father wolf playin frisbee with flying saucers.. golden <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> on a more serious note, my current game is a mummy/demon hybrid. i have very little to add, except that i gave the GM a bigger place in Irem's history. they called it Atun. the nomads of the deserts north of Irem seemed to call favor from it (along with other tribal deities). these peoples, whod later be thought of as the ancestors of hebrews and arabs, had oracles that would read the design of the machine. of course, the machine didnt seem to care when their city of Ubar vanished, or when Ki-En-Gar fell to Irem. though, millenia later, Atun rears its ugly CPU again during the reign of Ahkenaten, when IT nearly whipes out the remnants of the worship of the Old Gods in Egypt. before/after this, there was the whole Moses incident when a Deathless worshipper of Atun controled/was Moses and started a slave revolution. you could very easily say Irem and the Machine go waaaay back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T19:38:10-08:00","id":23456,"title":"","content":"I'd think they'd likely see it as one expansive, reality-warping relic and try to seize it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/237-dagcon-faraday","name":"Dagcon Faraday","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}